+# Provenance - Seasons 19-30 candidate 1
+
+Unofficial Erbium-based server/client components for Reboot Launcher.
+
+- Erbium: https://github.com/plooshi/Erbium, commit
+  44568e08cbe411ba197d3e0e900685750d46afdc; GPL-3.0.
+- Tellurium authentication: https://github.com/plooshi/Tellurium, commit
+  8750678312c011888b82878fb1d011b97b33fff5; BSD-3-Clause.
+- Existing portable LawinServer backend: commit
+  7f0f26d7a772c6122c42b1783fd75f497e86d3a9; GPL-3.0.
+- Launcher integration was checked against Auties00/Reboot-Launcher commit
+  c6f82298b167ef2076bb59dc621f13dc5bd8d390.
+
+The build begins with the original source archive, applies revision2.patch,
+then seasons19-30.patch. This preserves the earlier ProcessEvent lookup fixes.
+The new patch expands release selection, removes the forced 27.11 runtime
+version, centralizes the existing map/reflection/replication choices, adds
+startup diagnostics and missing-object checks, and updates build/setup files.
+The historical Reboot2711 directory name is retained in source for patch-chain
+continuity; it no longer implies an exact 27.11 runtime restriction.
+
+Native signatures and gameplay code remain from Erbium. New version acceptance
+is not verification of those signatures or offsets. Tellurium retains the
+previous bounded scanner/hook/URL changes; the season-range overlay updates
+its package names and diagnostics without claiming newly verified game ABIs.
+
+The build publishes matching source with the binaries and retains upstream
+licenses. No Fortnite executable or game content is distributed. Exact workflow
+commit, run URL and DLL hashes are recorded in BUILD-INFO.txt and SHA256SUMS.txt.
