+# Reboot Seasons 19-30 - experimental candidate 1
+
+Windows x64 server/client DLLs for Fortnite **19.xx through 30.xx**, based on
+Erbium, with a matching Tellurium authentication build for Reboot Launcher.
+Use [SETUP.md](SETUP.md) for installation and [COMPATIBILITY.md](COMPATIBILITY.md)
+for the supported code paths and remaining runtime limits.
+
+This expands the earlier 27.11-only candidate. It parses the actual game release,
+keeps the engine version separate, selects the chapter's Battle Royale island,
+and uses the existing engine/patch-specific reflection and replication paths.
+It rejects releases outside 19-30 and engines outside UE 5.0-5.5.
+
+The Windows workflow compiles the DLLs and runs synthetic startup/profile checks.
+**This is not a claim that every patch is playable.** Upstream labels 20.00-30.00
+as partial support. Later 30.xx labels are accepted experimentally without new
+verified native offsets. A complete 27.11 match was not established in the prior
+session; the client's loading stall and a reported host crash remain unresolved.
+
+Run BUILD.cmd on Windows with Visual Studio 2022 C++ tools to build the server
+and client. Outputs go to dist-S19-S30. The CI workflow also builds and packages
+the matching authentication DLL and corresponding sources.
+
+This project contains no Fortnite game binaries. Retain the GPL-3.0 license,
+upstream notices and corresponding source when redistributing these DLLs.
+
+Upstream: [plooshi/Erbium](https://github.com/plooshi/Erbium), commit
+44568e08cbe411ba197d3e0e900685750d46afdc. This is an unofficial derivative;
+upstream has not endorsed or verified this candidate.
